{"overview":"لحظه‌ای پس از نجات از حمله کامل خانواده لِ دوماس، گریس می‌فهمد که به سطح بعدی بازی کابوس‌وار رسیده است – و این بار با خواهر جدا شده‌اش فِیت در کنارش؛ گریس یک فرصت برای زنده ماندن، حفظ جان خواهرش و ادعا کردن صندلی بالای شورای کنترل‌کننده جهان دارد؛ چهار خانواده رقابتی او را برای تخت تاج‌گذاری تعقیب می‌کنند و هرکسی که برنده شود همه چیز را کنترل می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Moments after surviving an all-out attack from the Le Domas family, Grace discovers she’s reached the next level of the nightmarish game — and this time with her estranged sister Faith at her side. Grace has one chance to survive, keep her sister alive, and claim the High Seat of the Council that controls the world. Four rival families are hunting her for the throne, and whoever wins rules it all.","tagline_en":"Double or nothing.","runtime":108,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["مت بتینلی-اولپین","Tyler Gillett"],"crew_en":["Matt Bettinelli-Olpin","Tyler Gillett"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"سامارا ویوینگ","role":"Grace MacCaullay","photo":"/ngVKl0sxrut5PPMAIDsfXrVjA1R.jpg","en":"Samara Weaving"},{"name":"کاترین نیوتون","role":"Faith MacCaullay","photo":"/3mos4oK6bps0uhQzW1L7nj5O0Gd.jpg","en":"Kathryn Newton"},{"name":"سارا میشل گلر","role":"Ursula Danforth","photo":"/grlhyolOpwZAnpeFvuTC3SQAUij.jpg","en":"Sarah Michelle Gellar"},{"name":"Shawn Hatosy","role":"Titus Danforth","photo":"/hm3KRxmotbJ93fJQJvE0G0EGONw.jpg"},{"name":"Nestor Carbonell","role":"Ignacio El Caido","photo":"/4Xn03t2qDEMR2ecM7BtLwpvs3J0.jpg"},{"name":"David Cronenberg","role":"Chester Danforth","photo":"/3xh4e2gWHDilMLtucHzDGsmJMuQ.jpg"},{"name":"الایجا وود","role":"The Lawyer","photo":"/7UKRbJBNG7mxBl2QQc5XsAh6F8B.jpg","en":"Elijah Wood"},{"name":"کوین دوراند","role":"Bill Wilkinson","photo":"/hINvryvce5tpod6kTnUg9ZTH8wg.jpg","en":"Kevin Durand"},{"name":"Olivia Cheng","role":"Wan Chen Xing","photo":"/c1rOhwVuZi3v47fuTAnVVB4XuSc.jpg"},{"name":"Varun Saranga","role":"Madhu Ra